      "body_sha256": "d055e46d2d113ed47ae8c7edb9df63949be4c69df5d839c840b13ffead0ad73d",
      "title_en": "🇨🇦 New tools and materials at our Hamilton bead studio!",
      "body_en": "We have added fabric decorations and rhinestones! Beadcraft techniques are moving so quickly that I can barely keep up, haha. The little bows are adorable—I love them and will be using lots of them!\n\nI bought some larger ironing cloths so even big designs can get an even textured finish. Corduroy has arrived too!\n\nA shipment of felt boards also arrived. Friends took a few, and I plan to put up another couple myself. The remaining boards are available if anyone happens to want them.\n\nHere are some recent pieces made by our guests as well. They are almost too cute!",
      "date": "2026-07-31"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6aa39a000000000c003002",
      "title": "🇨🇦拼豆日记之填满毛毡板进度+1",
      "body": "米卡桑太帅了，三笠帅我一跳又一跳，看一次被帅到一次[哇R][哇R][哇R] 真是我近期最满意的拼豆！\n感谢老师做图@慕容相天\n终于把潜伏的四个图完结了，很好，妹子你真棒！\n感谢老师@勤奋小王每天早起做俯卧撑\nKitty的图真是做不完，一个比一个可爱，暂时就做这些。最近也有在做一些抽象图纸哈哈哈哈，很快就能填满所有毛毡板了！\n#拼豆豆届梗王[话题]# #拼豆[话题]# #小红书拼豆地图[话题]# #万物皆可拼[话题]# #撤退の矮人[话题]# #三笠[话题]# #潜伏[话题]# #翠萍[话题]# #抽象[话题]# #毛毡板[话题]#",
