      "body_sha256": "3da80cd73f3245a60a9583a38cef25c8e39801383c9e7ed4fee7bb279c0b6b34",
      "title_en": "🇨🇦 Bead journal: one step closer to filling the felt boards",
      "body_en": "Mikasa looks so cool. Every time I look at her, I am impressed all over again. This is one of my favourite recent bead pieces!\nThank you to @慕容相天 for the pattern.\n\nI finally finished all four Lurk designs. Nice work, girl!\nThank you to @勤奋小王每天早起做俯卧撑 for the patterns.\n\nThere are endlessly more Kitty patterns, each cuter than the last. I will stop at these for now. I have also been making some wonderfully silly designs lately, haha. All the felt boards will be full soon!",
      "date": "2026-07-29"
    },
