      "body_sha256": "a8ea3abf35e363f8b3542763d20e02a4b25f988ea1f2f4f2becf264197a9c10b",
      "title_en": "Gingerbread puppy bead patterns: a set of nine 🍪",
      "body_en": "I mainly used the gingerbread patterns by @小绿同学. The linked post contains six of the puppies, but three others did not quite fit what I wanted, so I looked at some different designs.\n\nFor one puppy, I used the colours from another pattern by @小绿同学. Search their profile for “一袋线条小狗饼干” (a bag of Line Puppy cookies). I only borrowed the colours; the size did not fit, so I kept the dimensions of the original six patterns.\n\nFor the other two, I used the colours from patterns by @麻酱拌面. Search their profile for “熊请你饼干啦” (the bear is treating you to cookies). Again, I only used the colours. Choose whichever you like, or improvise. These patterns are small and forgiving.\n\nThank you to the pattern creators! I improvised a little and put them in a wooden frame. They look so cute, haha—I recommend trying it. The inside of the frame measures 20 × 20 cm.",
