      "body_sha256": "48b625a4deac45e2d9d4b978e388da12621b4cd93c4307efe807d2e1de5f5fa1",
      "title_en": "🇨🇦 Sharing my little bead studio with friends 🏠😋",
      "body_en": "I have spent the past two months decorating my beadcraft home studio. Around graduation season I moved to a new place and set aside an empty room. My shipment by sea arrived last month too. These colourful felt boards look lovely—I recommend them! Now all that is left is to fill them. Time to get back to making beads!\n\nThe felt boards I bought are 30 cm squares, spaced 20 cm apart. The hook-and-loop backing is very secure. I added a layer of masking tape to protect the wall finish.",
